      "reason": "Catalogue states 100 % volume runtime is 10 h, not 20 h."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Using a twenty-watt wall adapter, a fully discharged ClearTrail Plus reaches a complete charge in ninety minutes, so a short charging stop is enough to restore the entire battery.",
      "label": "unknown",
      "fact_ids": [],
      "reason": "Charging time is not provided in the catalogue."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Orders for ClearTrail Plus receive free delivery to every India postal code, so there is no separate shipping charge even when a customer selects a remote delivery address.",
      "label": "unknown",
